1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,000
The install videos end at one audit file on one machine. This is the other half.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Connect a workspace and the same decisions become a shared console.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Activity is the live feed: one row per governed tool call, across every agent.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Tool, decision, identity, latency — and for model calls, tokens and cost.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Open a call and you get the reason: how it was classified, and which rule decided.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Approvals is a queue a human works — not a prompt someone missed at 2am.

7
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:52,000
Nothing here has executed. High risk, irreversible, blast radius, stated up front.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Policies: allow, ask, or deny per tool — the same file, shared by the team.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
And the money view: what each run cost, split by step, so you can see where it went.

10
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Real workspace, real traffic. Connect one and it starts filling in.
